  "subdivision_of_building": "The proposed development is limited to a single-storey rear extension to the ground floor flat (52B) within a two-storey semi-detached property that has been converted into two self-contained flats: 52A (first floor) and 52B (ground floor). The extension only affects the footprint of 52B, and does not involve any structural or internal changes to 52A, nor does it alter the full extent of the overall building.",
